  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/banner_about.png\" alt=\"蓝色横幅，粉色镶边，上书“关于”\"></p>\n<p>Excessive Building 是一款旨在通过添加全新的方块套装来增强建造体验的模组，而非在 Minecraft 原有的方块库基础上进行扩展。</p>\n<p><em>欢迎将此项目加入整合包！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jmHpajd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/discord_icon.png\" alt=\"像素风格的 Discord 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyirmiri.zeus.kitchen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/bluesky_icon.png\" alt=\"由蓝色蝴蝶组成的像素风格 Bluesky 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Yirmiris\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/twitter_icon.png\" alt=\"由蓝色小鸟组成的像素风格 Twitter/X 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Yirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/youtube_icon.png\" alt=\"带有播放按钮的红色矩形像素风格 YouTube 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yirmiri/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/curseforge_icon.png\" alt=\"橙色铁砧图案的像素风格 CurseForge 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fYirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/modrinth_icon.png\" alt=\"绿色圆形中心带扳手的像素风格 Modrinth 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fyirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/kofi_icon.png\" alt=\"印有红心的马克杯图案像素风格 Ko-Fi 标志\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyirmiri.carrd.co%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/carrd_icon.png\" alt=\"黑色心上叠加白色心的像素风格 Azurune 标志\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/banner_projects.png\" alt=\"蓝色横幅，粉色镶边，上书“Azurune 项目”\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/excessive-building\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/EB_icon.png\" alt=\"Excessive Building 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delicate-dyes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/DDyes_icon.png\" alt=\"Delicate Dyes 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yapping-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/YT_icon.png\" alt=\"Yapping Tooltips 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/runiclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/TL_icon.png\" alt=\"RunicLib 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/urban-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/UD_icon.png\" alt=\"Urban Decor 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/DD_icon.png\" alt=\"Dungeon&#x27;s Delight 模组的标志与跳转链接\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fYirmiri%253fr%253dCF%2bEB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yirmiri/Dried-Spice/master/src/main/resources/assets/dried_spice/textures/description/excessive_building/excessive_building_bisect.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting 服务器首月八折优惠广告横幅，提示结账时使用优惠码“Yirmiri”\"></a></p>\n<p>如需卓越的服务器托管服务，首选 BisectHosting。<strong>新客户可使用优惠码“Yirmiri”享受首月八折优惠</strong>,\n其客服团队也将随时为您提供全方位的支持。</p>\n<h2><strong>⚙️常见问题解答⚙️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>我想反馈一个问题/漏洞，应该在哪里提交？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong>您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Excessive-Building/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 页面</a> 上提交 Bug 报告，请先查看是否有人已报告过相同问题，以避免重复提交。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>我对模组有一些建议，应该在哪里提交？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong>您可以在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jmHpajd\" rel=\"nofollow\">我们的 Discord 服务器</a> 中留下模组建议，请确保遵守发帖指南。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>问：</strong>会移植到 <strong>X</strong> 版本吗？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong>目前没有计划移植到任何更早的 Minecraft 版本，但我会尽量让模组跟随我所游玩的最新 Minecraft 版本保持更新。</li>\n</ul>",
